GET (Listar todos os times)
curl.exe -X GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/times
2. POST (Cadastrar um novo time)
curl.exe -X POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/times -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"nome":"MIBR", "sigla":"MIBR", "pais":"Brasil", "regiao":"SA", "ano_fundacao":2003, "ranking":15}'
3. GET por ID (Buscar o time criado)
curl.exe -X GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/times/1
4. PUT (Atualizar dados de um time)
curl.exe -X PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/times/1 -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"nome":"MIBR Red", "sigla":"MIBR", "pais":"Brasil", "regiao":"SA", "ano_fundacao":2003, "ranking":10}'
5. DELETE (Remover um time)
curl.exe -X DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/times/1
